        description: "Master the biological foundations of plant growth, nutrition, and health for controlled environment agriculture. This comprehensive course covers plant anatomy, physiology, nutrition, hormones, genetics, and integrated pest management.",
        thumbnail: "/thumbnails/thumb_104_plant_science_1766157615125.png",
        duration: "15 hours",
        price: 149,
