                        content: `# Structural Engineering for CEA Facilities

## Structure Types
**Gable:** Peak roof, snow shedding >45°, 12-20 ft height
**Gothic Arch:** Superior strength-to-weight, 15-25% better light
**Quonset/Hoop:** $2-5/sq ft, <25 psf snow capacity
**Venlo:** Multi-span glass, $25-50/sq ft commercial
**Indoor Vertical:** Insulated, artificial light, multi-tier

## Load Analysis

### Dead Loads: Film 0.15 psf | Poly 2.0 psf | Glass 3.5 psf | Frame 2-4 psf | Equipment 5-10 psf

### Snow Loads
**Flat Roof:** Pf = 0.7 × Ce × Ct × Is × Pg (Ct=0.85 heated)
**Sloped:** Ps = Cs × Pf where Cs = 1.0 - (slope-30)/40 for 30-70°
**Example:** 30 psf ground, 45° heated = 11.2 psf design

### Wind Loads
**Pressure:** P = q × G × Cp
**Velocity:** q = 0.00256 × Kz × Kzt × Kd × V²
**100 mph:** Windward +12.6 psf, Roof -14.2 psf uplift

### Load Combinations (ASCE 7)
1. 1.4 DL
2. 1.2 DL + 1.6 LL + 0.5 S
3. 1.2 DL + 1.6 S + 0.5 LL (critical)
4. 0.9 DL + 1.0 W (uplift)

## Materials
**Steel:** 36-50 ksi yield, E=29,000 ksi, galvanize for corrosion
**Aluminum:** 25-35 ksi, E=10,000 ksi, corrosion resistant
**Wood:** Douglas Fir Fb=900 psi, low cost, limited spans

## Foundations
**Types:** Continuous footing, Pier/grade beam, Slab-on-grade, Helical anchors
**Frost Depth:** South 12-18" | Central 24-36" | North 42-60"
**Soil Bearing:** Soft clay 1,000-2,000 psf | Dense sand 3,000-6,000 psf

## Deflection (IBC)
**Roof:** L/180 | **Floor:** L/360 | **Cantilever:** L/120
**Formula:** δ = (5wL⁴)/(384EI)

## Connections
**1/2" A307 Bolt:** 4,700 lbs shear
**Anchor Embedment:** ≥12 diameters
**3/4" Epoxy:** 8,000-12,000 lbs tension

## Code Compliance
**IBC Groups:** U (Utility), A-4 (Public), B (Commercial)
**Permits:** Structures >120 sq ft, PE stamped drawings
**Inspections:** Foundation, Framing, Final

**References:** ASCE 7, IBC, AISC, NDS, ADM`
