                        content: `# Conducting Mock Recalls

Practice makes perfect. Regular mock recalls test and improve your systems.

## Why Mock Recalls?

| Reason | Benefit |
|--------|---------|
| Test systems | Find gaps before real emergency |
| Train staff | Everyone knows their role |
| Meet requirements | Some certifications require them |
| Build confidence | Ready when it matters |

## Mock Recall Procedure

### Step 1: Create Scenario

\`\`\`
SAMPLE SCENARIO

Date: April 28
Situation: Local health department contacts you.
A customer at Restaurant B reported illness after
eating salad on April 26. They suspect your lettuce.

Your task: Identify all potentially affected product
and customers within 4 hours.
\`\`\`

### Step 2: Activate Traceback

| Action | Time Target |
|--------|-------------|
| Identify lot(s) shipped to Restaurant B on/before April 26 | 30 minutes |
| Find all records for those lots | 30 minutes |
| Identify all other recipients of same lot(s) | 30 minutes |
| Compile complete report | 30 minutes |

### Step 3: Document Findings

\`\`\`
MOCK RECALL REPORT

Date of exercise: April 28
Scenario: Illness report from Restaurant B

TRACEBACK RESULTS:
Product: Butterhead lettuce
Lot(s) potentially affected: GH1-0425-A
Harvest date: April 25
Growing location: Greenhouse 1, Rafts 5-8
Seed lot: JS-2024-0315

TRACEFORWARD RESULTS:
Total quantity in lot: 200 heads
Distribution:
- Restaurant A: 50 heads (Invoice #1247)
- Restaurant B: 75 heads (Invoice #1248)
- Farmers market: 75 heads (cash sales)

CONTACTS:
- Restaurant A: (555) 123-4567, Chef Maria
- Restaurant B: (555) 234-5678, Manager Tom

Time to complete: 2 hours 15 minutes
\`\`\`

### Step 4: Evaluate Performance

| Metric | Target | Actual | Pass/Fail |
|--------|--------|--------|-----------|
| Time to complete | <4 hours | 2:15 | Pass |
| Lot identification | 100% | 100% | Pass |
| Customer identification | 100% | 95%* | Review |
| Contact info available | 100% | 100% | Pass |

*Farmers market sales not individually tracked

## Improvement Actions

### Common Gaps Found

| Gap | Solution |
|-----|----------|
| Missing lot on some invoices | Add lot field to invoice template |
| Couldn't find old records | Improve filing system |
| No contact info for one customer | Update customer database |
| Farmers market not tracked | Implement sign-up sheet |

### Follow-Up

\`\`\`
CORRECTIVE ACTIONS

Gap identified: Farmers market sales not tracked to individuals
Action: Implement optional customer sign-up for recall notifications
Responsible: Farm manager
Due date: May 15
Completed: [  ]
\`\`\`

## Mock Recall Frequency

| Certification | Requirement |
|---------------|-------------|
| GAP | Annually recommended |
| GLOBALG.A.P. | Required |
| Best practice | Twice per year |`
